#: protected/views/join/index.php:41
msgctxt "join"
msgid "About KDE eV"
msgstr "O KDE eV"

#: protected/views/join/index.php:43
msgctxt "join"
msgid ""
"KDE eV is a non-profit organization that represents the KDE Project in legal "
"and financial matters."
msgstr ""
"KDE eV je neprofitna organizacija koja predstavlja KDE Projekat u pravnim i "
"finansijskim pitanjima."

#: protected/views/join/index.php:45
msgctxt "join"
msgid ""
"Read more at the <a href=\"http://ev.kde.org\">eV site</a> and in the <a "
"href=\"http://ev.kde.org/reports/\">eV reports</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pročitaj više na <a href=\"http://ev.kde.org\">eV stranici</a> i u <a href="
"\"http://ev.kde.org/reports/\">eV izvještajima</a>."

#: protected/views/join/index.php:52
msgctxt "join"
msgid ""
"KDE has awesome technology developed by an incredible community, it's an "
"honor to join the game\n"
"<br />\n"
"- Georg Greve, founder FSFE"
msgstr ""
"KDE ima fenomenalne tehnologije razvijene od strane nevjerovatne zajednice, "
"čast je pridružiti se igri\n"
"<br />\n"
"- Georg Greve, osnivač FSFE"

